      "key": "SFCC-195",
      "summary": "PDP – Product Information Accordion",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to access detailed product information in an organised, expandable format on the PDP,\nso that\n I can find the information I need without leaving the product page.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading):\nThe PDP displays a set of accordion tabs below the primary CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content. Accordion content is managed in Contentful and does not require a code deployment to update, with the exception of product-specific content sourced from SFCC (e.g. Details & Care, Size & Fit).\nThe confirmed accordion tabs are: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance. \nThe Environmental Qualities accordion (PRD-009) is an EU-only tab that renders only when the product has the relevant AP21 attribute populated. It must not display for non-EU storefronts or when no environmental data exists for the product.",
