      "summary": "PLP UI – Inline Grid Insert",
      "description": "As a \nShopper, \nI want\n to see curated editorial and featured content within the product grid as I browse, \nso that\n my browsing experience feels elevated and I can discover campaign stories alongside products.\nThis story covers the PWA build of the inline grid insert component that appears within the product grid on category pages. The insert is a flexible component that supports multiple content variants, configurable per category. Multiple inserts on the same page alternate between left and right positioning. Regular product tiles fill the remaining columns alongside each insert.\nThe component supports the following variants as per design:\nCampaign image insert\n — a large format editorial/campaign image occupying one column spanning 2 product rows, with regular product tiles in the remaining columns alongside it.\nCampaign image + editorial text insert \n— a large format editorial/campaign image occupying one column spanning 2 product rows, with editorial title, body copy, and a CTA link in the upper portion of the adjacent column, and product tiles below.\nFeatured product tile insert\n — a large format product tile occupying one column spanning 2 product rows, with regular product tiles in the remaining columns alongside it.\nThe component can be built with mock content prior to the Contentful content model being finalised. Content authoring setup in Contentful is covered in a separate story.\n\n\nReference Images:",
