      "id": "18304",
      "key": "SFCC-186",
      "summary": "PDP – Product Image Gallery",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to view multiple product images on the PDP,\nso that\n I can see the product from different angles and in full detail before deciding to buy.\nImage for reference (Figma leading): \nThe PDP displays a product image gallery sourced from SFCC BM. Images are managed at the colour variation level if there are multiple colours — switching colour updates the gallery without a full page reload. If there is only 1 colour - images are managed at the master product level.\nOn desktop the gallery renders as a stacked editorial layout (large hero followed by another large image, then supporting images in a 2x2 grid). On mobile the gallery renders as a full-width swipeable carousel with dot indicators.\nThe primary hero image is priority-loaded. A consistent aspect ratio is maintained across all images. Alt text is required on all images before a product can be published.\nVideo content within the gallery is out of scope — see SFCC-188",
